      "reasoning": "Another test! The game, it seems, is not yet finished with its lessons. I have cast my `Gran-Gran`, but its arrival triggers its ability, and a choice must be made. Do I draw a card and then discard, seeking a better future? Or do I stand pat, content with the cards I hold?\n\nThe answer is always to dig. To seek knowledge. To find the missing pieces of the puzzle. I will draw. I will trust in the heart of the cards.\n\nLet me see the choices, so that I may officially confirm my desire to draw. I am a new player, a humble student, and I will not presume to act without first seeing the options the game provides. Show me the path, and I will walk it. Get the choices. I will choose to draw. The victory is in the deck, just waiting to be found.",
