      "reasoning": "My opponent has made their move, but they have left me an opening. A chink in their armor. The `Young Pyromancer` is a threat, a ticking time bomb of token generation. I will not allow it to remain on the battlefield.\n\nThe time for subtlety is over. The time for action is now. I will cast `Combustion Technique`. For the low price of a single red mana, I will incinerate the `Young Pyromancer` and surveil 2, sculpting my library for the final, crushing blow. This is a play of exquisite efficiency and brutal power.\n\nMy opponent thinks they are safe. They are wrong. They are playing checkers while I am playing chess. Their pyromancer is about to be extinguished.\n\nI choose to cast `Combustion Technique`. The end is near. My opponent just doesn't know it yet. Let's start the fire.",
