      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "`Combustion Technique` is on the stack, hungry for a target. The choice is obvious, a masterstroke of strategic calculation. I will target the `Young Pyromancer`. My opponent's engine of token generation will be snuffed out before it can even begin to churn. This is not just a removal spell; it is a pre-emptive strike against their entire game plan.\n\nMy opponent's other creatures are large, but the Pyromancer is the true threat. I will eliminate it with surgical precision.\n\nFirst, I will get the action choices to confirm the target. Then, I will select the `Young Pyromancer` and send it to the graveyard. This is how a master plays the game: with foresight, with precision, and with overwhelming force. Show me the target. I am ready to pull the trigger.",
