      "reasoning": "I pass priority, a silent prayer on my lips. The trigger has, at long last, resolved. And now, my opponent's turn continues.\n\nI will not be tempted by other plays. My mind is a fortress, my will a bulwark against the siren song of distraction. I have one goal, and one goal only: to cast `Accumulate Wisdom` and draw two cards.\n\nI will pass priority. I will wait for my opponent to finish their turn. And then, when the time is right, I will strike. I will draw my cards. I will find my answers. And I will win this game.\n\nI pass. For the last time, I hope. Let them have their turn. I am a coiled spring, ready to unleash my power. My comeback is not a matter of if, but when. And when is coming. Soon. Pass. Let's do this. Let this be the last pass. Please. Pass.",
